+| `3342e5d8` | `METALSIM_CHANGES.md` rows for `8631b6b0` and `fddebdbd`. Franka-Pour MPM, captured step at 2,048 worlds with the two Newton commits of the same work (`metalsim-1.5.2`): 90.5-91.2 -> 78.9-79.0 ms. |
+| `270660b1` | Capture memory reuse (`41b7bc45`) is opt-in, `WP_METAL_CAPTURE_REUSE=1`, until a GPU page fault it causes is understood. With reuse, Isaac Lab's Franka-Pour MPM step captured at one world fails with `kIOGPUCommandBufferCallbackErrorPageFault` (`pour_bitwise.py record --worlds 1 --mode capture`; 64 and 2,048 worlds pass). Without reuse, captures behave as at `43ffc6dd`. The working-set warning and the host-written-memory tracking stay. `TestMetal.test_capture_reuses_memory_freed_during_capture` runs only with reuse on. |
